{"channelId":"UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","row":["Sidewalk Specials",68900,"Sidewalk Specials are a mass sterilisation unit & dog rescue based in the township of De Doorns, South Africa. \n\nWe are PBO approved & can issue Section 18A certificates for donations received. \n\nNPC 2017/316326/08, NPO 230-918, PBO 930059565, UK CIC 9957429\n\nSidewalk Specials work through a culture of respect, education & upliftment, helping township families care for their pets.\n\nWe provide free vet care with the understanding that sterilisation is mandatory.\n\nWe run regular, free mass sterilisation drives in order to control overpopulation.\n\nWe provide free kennels for sterilised dogs to ensure they are safe from the elements.\n\nWe conduct weekly outreaches & check-ups to integrate with the community, earn their trust and educate the youth on pet ownership & care.\n\nWe provide free & effective chemotherapy treatment for dogs with TVT (Transmissible Venereal Tumors).\n\nWe safely rehome dogs from cases of abuse and/or severe neglect where education & upliftment are not possible.","","South Africa"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:29.252Z","channelId":"UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d33b3588f194cf0659fc04e3476f7d13bf49148e3721876eb9c65ab0014a8955","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"33ce0f03ca17fde16fb6199d3041ff97fccaf5b954e9ce1d02e06e23eaef29e9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:20:35.522Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":68900,"raw":"68.9K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUniVa5d3uny2GmhEQ33ruA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12